{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2022-12-28 22:20:00', 'title': 'BLACKROCK® CANADA ANNOUNCES FINAL DECEMBER CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE ISHARES® ETFS', 'text': 'TORONTO, DEC. 28, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BLACKROCK ASSET MANAGEMENT CANADA LIMITED (“BLACKROCK CANADA”), AN INDIRECT, WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF BLACKROCK, INC. (NYSE: BLK), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE FINAL DECEMBER CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE ISHARES ETFS LISTED ON THE TSX OR NEO, WITH THE EXCEPTION OF THE ISHARES PREMIUM MONEY MARKET ETF (“CMR”). FINAL CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR CMR WILL BE CONFIRMED IN A PRESS RELEASE TO BE ISSUED ON OR ABOUT DECEMBER 29, 2022. UNITHOLDERS OF RECORD OF A FUND ON DECEMBER 30, 2022 WILL RECEIVE CASH DISTRIBUTIONS PAYABLE IN RESPECT OF THAT FUND ON JANUARY 5, 2023.'}